# New job board sources for ZenRay Freelance (26 October 2026)

Every row below was checked by an HTTP request on 26 October 2026 (Python urllib, User-Agent Mozilla/5.0). "Open jobs" is the count returned by the public API at that moment; "TA/3D" counts titles matching `technical art|tech art|houdini|vfx|3d|environment|unreal|shader|lighting|material|texture|character art|prop`. None of these slugs is in the already configured list. False positives (same slug, unrelated company: amplitude, arena, ghost, jellyfish, mercury, moon, paradox, factory, focus, peak, mill, nexus, lens, lightspeed, promethean, rise, buf and mpc on Personio) were checked by reading the job titles and excluded.

Endpoint notes (26 October 2026):
- Lever has a separate EU region: studios on `jobs.eu.lever.co` answer only on `https://api.eu.lever.co/v0/postings/<slug>?mode=json` (404 on the US API). The crawler needs a `region` field.
- Teamtailor: `https://<slug>.teamtailor.com/jobs.rss` (RSS, one `<item>` per job).
- Personio: `https://<slug>.jobs.personio.de/xml` (one `<position>` per job).
- BambooHR: `https://<slug>.bamboohr.com/careers/list` (JSON `result[]`, `jobOpeningName`). Returns 200 even for unknown slugs, so trust only non-empty results.
- SmartRecruiters also returns 200 with 0 jobs for any slug: only non-empty boards are listed.
- Workable widget API rate-limits hard (429 after about 50 calls); crawl it slowly (one account every 10 s or more).

